  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The information submitted is of insufficient quality and content to be able to make an accurate assessment in terms of residential amenities. In the absence of an acoustic and odour report and details on what the flues are to be used for; officers are unable to make an accurate assessment in terms of amenity impacts of the proposed development. The proposal is therefore, contrary to policy LP2 and policy LP58 of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
